It sounds like auto-negotiation problems between a switch and the ALPHA.
It's been discussed several times in comp.os.vms, as well as comp.unix.aix
and comp.sys.hp.hpux.

The solution is to set the ALPHAs NIC and the switch's port to 100 Mbit
and full duplex.  


